#. translators: %s: the [sffilters] shortcode.
msgid "The panel shows these filters in this order. Place the panel with the %s shortcode, for example in a sidebar widget or in the shop template of your page builder."
msgstr "Panel prikazuje ove filtre ovim redoslijedom. Postavite ga kratkim kodom %s, na primjer u widget bočne trake ili u predložak trgovine u alatu za izradu stranica."

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filtar"

